--[[====================================================================
    AFS MAIN  -  REN HUB  (Anime Fighters Simulator)
    Written from scratch. AFS Guide was used only as a reference.

    Features
      Farm     : auto farm (any monster / nearest), click damage, yen collect,
                 meteor, time trial (+ auto join, skip room), raid
      Modes    : Infinity Tower (climbs every floor/tier, resumes on lose),
                 Dungeon (summon, join, clear rooms, doors, chests),
                 Gates Mode (rank select, summon, join, skip wait)
      Eggs     : any world / any egg - lists build themselves from the map
      Passive  : roll passives on many pets at once until a target passive
      Misc     : daily spin, tickets, merchant boost, codes, webhook, FPS boost
      Setting  : auto sell rarities, owner FX, anti AFK, remote spy
      Maps     : new worlds added by game updates show up in every list live

    Remote arguments: the game dump only lists remote NAMES. Every remote call
    goes through CFG.Calls. If a feature does nothing, turn on
    Setting > Remote Spy, do the action once by hand, read F9, fix that line.

    Hide / show the window: RightControl
======================================================================]]

